// =============================================================================
// MODUS ENEMIES DATA - Edit enemy stats and behavior here
// =============================================================================
// TIPS:
//   - "tier" = difficulty tier (1=weak, 2=medium, 3=strong, 4=boss)
//   - "role" = AI behavior type (basic, support, damage, swarm)
//   - "health" = hit points before death
//   - "damage" = damage dealt per attack
//   - "speed" = movement speed (higher = faster)
//   - "aggression" = how aggressively AI pursues targets (0.0 to 1.0)
// =============================================================================

